      {
        "id": 134261,
        "name": "Sejixs",
        "username": "Sejixs",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/sejixs/{size}/2392_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-02-28T01:03:11.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>First off, Hi Darrell! Welcome to the forums.  <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/grin.png?v=9\" title=\":grin:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":grin:\"></p>\n<p>Secondly, Compounded sounds like my cup of tea. A trading game dealing with Chemistry? Yes please!!</p>\n<p>Can I be annoying and ask how detailed does Compounded get into Chemistry? Can someone with no chemistry knowledge play this happily? And vice versa, in the sense can a Chemist play this and get really complex with this game?</p>",
        "post_number": 22,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:10:05.563Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
